                      "subject": "At 8:00 PM \u2022 At midnight \u2022 At noon \u2022 At Christmas \u2022 At Easter",
                      "rule": "Se usa para horas de reloj y festividades completas sin la palabra 'day'.",
                      "formula": "[ At ] + [ Hora exacta / midnight / noon / Christmas ]",
