                      "label": "5. Preguntas con Where/What (? Wh-)",
                      "subject": "Where did you travel? \u2022 What places did she visit?",
                      "rule": "Coloca la palabra Wh- antes de Did.",
                      "formula": "[ Where / What / How ] + [ did ] + [ Sujeto ] + [ Verbo base ] + ?",
