                      "type": "question-yn",
                      "label": "4. Respuestas Positivas y Negativas",
                      "subject": "Of course! / Sure, no problem! \u2022 I'm sorry, I don't have one right now.",
                      "rule": "C\xF3mo aceptar o rechazar amablemente una solicitud de ayuda.",
                      "formula": "[ Sure, here you go! ] \u2022 [ I'm sorry, but I can't right now ]",
