                      "label": "2. Expresar Acuerdo Total (+)",
                      "subject": "I totally agree with you \u2022 You are completely right \u2022 That is a great point",
                      "rule": "Usa estas frases cuando compartes 100% la idea de otra persona.",
                      "formula": "[ I totally agree with you ] + [ because + argumento de apoyo ]",
