                      "rule": "Usa 'won't' en el resultado o 'don't/doesn't' en la condici\xF3n.",
                      "formula": "[ If + Sujeto + don't / doesn't + Verbo ], + [ Sujeto + won't + Verbo ]",
                      "example": "If you don't sleep well tonight, you won't have energy for tomorrow's match.",
                      "exampleEs": "Si no duermes bien esta noche, no tendr\xE1s energ\xEDa para el partido de ma\xF1ana.",
