                      "type": "negative",
                      "label": "3. Superlativo Absoluto (the -est / the most)",
                      "subject": "The fastest \u2022 The biggest \u2022 The most powerful \u2022 The most thrilling",
                      "rule": "Destaca al n\xFAmero 1 de todo un grupo. SIEMPRE lleva 'the' adelante.",
                      "formula": "[ Sujeto ] + [ is / are ] + [ the + Adjetivo-est / the most + Adjetivo ] + [ in the world ]",
                      "example": "This new processor is the most powerful chip ever built for mobile devices.",
                      "exampleEs": "Este nuevo procesador es el chip m\xE1s potente jam\xE1s construido para dispositivos m\xF3viles.",
