                      "rule": "F\xF3rmulas diplom\xE1ticas para solicitar favores o informaci\xF3n.",
                      "formula": "[ Could you please ] + [ verbo base ] + [ at your earliest convenience? ]",
                      "example": "Could you please confirm if the assignment deadline can be extended until Friday?",
