                      "rule": "Condici\xF3n imaginaria en pasado + consecuencia con would.",
                      "formula": "[ If + Sujeto + Pasado Simple ] , [ Sujeto + would + Verbo Base ]",
                      "example": "If I had the ability to teleport, I would have breakfast in Paris and lunch in Tokyo.",
                      "exampleEs": "Si tuviera la habilidad de teletransportarme, desayunar\xEDa en Par\xEDs y almorzar\xEDa en Tokio.",
