                      "subject": "If I were you, I would study \u2022 If he were the president, he would build parks",
                      "rule": "Usa 'were' formalmente con I, he, she, it en el condicional irreal.",
                      "formula": "[ If I were you ] , [ I would + Verbo Base ]",
                      "example": "If I were in your position, I would accept that international exchange scholarship.",
                      "exampleEs": "Si estuviera en tu lugar, aceptar\xEDa esa beca de intercambio internacional.",
                      "audio": "If I were in your position, I would accept that international exchange scholarship."
