                      "label": "4. B\xFAsqueda de Equilibrio: TO STRIKE A BALANCE BETWEEN",
                      "subject": "Can we strike a balance between innovation and ethics?",
                      "rule": "La frase cumbre para mediaciones constructivas.",
                      "formula": "[ We must strike a healthy balance between + Elemento A + and + Elemento B ]",
                      "example": "Our goal as school leaders is to strike a fair balance between academic excellence and mental health.",
                      "exampleEs": "Nuestra meta como l\xEDderes escolares es lograr un equilibrio justo entre la excelencia acad\xE9mica y la salud mental.",
                      "audio": "Our goal as school leaders is to strike a fair balance between academic excellence and mental health."
