                      "example": "Empirical telemetry revealed a forty-five percent reduction in energy dissipation during quantum processor cycles.",
                      "exampleEs": "La telemetr\xEDa emp\xEDrica revel\xF3 una reducci\xF3n del cuarenta y cinco por ciento en la disipaci\xF3n de energ\xEDa durante los ciclos del procesador cu\xE1ntico.",
                      "audio": "Empirical telemetry revealed a forty-five percent reduction in energy dissipation during quantum processor cycles."
